// Template for machine-specific signing config.
//
// Copy this file to `Local.xcconfig` (gitignored) and set your Apple
// Developer team ID. GestureLab's `Lab/Signing.xcconfig` includes it, so
// automatic signing finds the team without it ever being written into the
// committed project file.
//
// Use the Team ID from the developer account membership page or the signing
// certificate subject's OU field — not the parenthesized suffix printed by
// `security find-identity -v -p codesigning`, which can differ.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
